.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Get Merch\" data-label=\"\" style=\"background-color: rgb(19, 191, 129); border-color: rgb(19, 191, 129);\">Get Merch<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div id=\"f-this-el-461\" class=\"block bgptob\" style=\"padding: 75px 10%;\">\n<div class=\"elements\">\n<div id=\"f-this-el-462\" class=\"block vam\" style=\"margin-right: auto; margin-left: auto; width: 100%; max-width: 1200px; float: none; text-align: center;\">\n<div class=\"elements\">\n<h2 id=\"f-this-el-469\" style=\"margin-right: 45px; margin-bottom: 0px; width: auto; display: inline-block; color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Ready to be wowed by your data? Let&rsquo;s talk.<\/h2>\n<p><a id=\"f-this-el-470\" class=\"button\" href=\"\/contact\/\" title=\"Contact Ann\" data-label=\"\" style=\"width: auto; display: inline-block; color: rgb(100, 50, 198); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); border-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\">Contact Ann<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div id=\"f-this-el-313\" class=\"block\" style=\"padding: 75px 10%; display: none;\">\n<div class=\"elements\">\n<div id=\"f-this-el-314\" class=\"block\" style=\"width: 100%; float: none;\">\n<div class=\"elements\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"\/wp-content\/themes\/colonel\/assets\/img\/banner.jpg\" alt=\"\" title=\"\" id=\"f-this-el-315\" style=\"margin-right: 30px; margin-bottom: 30px; margin-left: 30px; width: 200px; display: inline-block;\"><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Spreadsheets to Stories Ann K. Emery is the founder of Depict Data Studio, where she&rsquo;s been equipping professionals with data visualization skills for more than a decade. Through hands-on workshops, online courses, and consulting engagements, Ann transforms dense spreadsheets into clear, compelling visuals using everyday tools like Excel. Her practical, accessible approach empowers you to &#8230; <a class=\"read-more\" href=\"https:\/\/d